Help
The keys in effect, and every command by category                                        56 commands

╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Keys                                                                                             │
│ enter                         send the prompt                                                    │
│ shift+enter / alt+enter / ctrl+j                                                                 │
│                               new line                                                           │
│ esc                           set a card aside, stop a chat turn, or pause the run               │
│ ctrl+c                        clear the prompt, twice to exit                                    │
│ ctrl+d                        exit, twice on an empty prompt                                     │
│ shift+tab                     next approval mode                                                 │
│ ctrl+o                        detailed transcript                                                │
│ ctrl+t                        workflow view                                                      │
│ ctrl+g                        edit the prompt in $EDITOR                                         │
│ left                          crew view, on an empty prompt                                      │
│ down                          agent panel, on an empty prompt                                    │
│ ctrl+r                        search prompt history                                              │
│ ?                             shortcuts, on an empty prompt                                      │
│ up                            take queued messages back                                          │
│ tab / up                      answer a waiting card                                              │
│                                                                                                  │
│ Session                                                                                          │
│ /clear                        Start a fresh chat with the lead. Runs keep going                  │
│ /resume                       Pick an earlier conversation or a run to carry on                  │
│ /exit                         Close the screen. Runs keep going                                  │
│ /compact [instructions]       Summarize the conversation to free context                         │
│ /rename [name]                Rename the conversation                                            │
│ /branch [name]                Start a new conversation from here and keep this one               │
│ /fork [prompt]                Copy the conversation into a new background session                │
